Annual foot check + lipid control"], "urgency": "routine", "dietPlan": {"summary": "Balanced plate to keep sugar steady and protect eyes.", "dos": ["Whole grains: jowar, bajra, brown rice (1.5 cups)", "Dal + veg daily, 2 tsp oil", "Fruit: 1 small guava/papaya", "Walk 30 min daily"], "donts": ["Avoid sugary tea, cold drinks, sweets", "Avoid fried snacks", "Avoid skipping meals"], "dailyCalories": "1400-1600 kcal", "followUp": "Annual eye check"}}');
