 "recommendedActions": ["Re-screen 6m, tighten glycemic control", "BP/lipid optimization, smoking cessation", "Patient education: report floaters/flashes immediately"], "urgency": "routine", "dietPlan": {"summary": "Tighten control to stop mild changes from growing.", "dos": ["Millet + dal + green veg", "1 fruit and almonds", "Salt <5g, BP check", "Walk 30-45 min"], "donts": ["No added sugar or sweet drinks", "Limit salt and packaged snacks", "No tobacco"], "dailyCalories": "1400-1500 kcal", "followUp": "Eye check in 6 months"}}');
